Dependency targets gruntled cannot map to a module stay silent for GRT001:
a directory without terragrunt.hcl, a directory holding only
terragrunt.stack.hcl (02-07 G2), a config_path naming a non-default file
(02-07 G4), and a label no dependency block declares. The one missing
output of a valid target is reported. A unit with a duplicate dependency
label is config-unknown.

Phase 5 (GRT002, reviewed by hand): edge/nodir exists but holds only a
README.md, so Terragrunt would refuse the "nodir" dependency and the GRT002
at its config_path value is correct. The stack dir (unresolved,
config-path-stack) and alt.hcl (unresolved, config-path-nondefault-file)
stay silent for GRT002 too; edge/dup is config-unknown and carries no edges.
-- edge/target/terragrunt.hcl --
inputs = {}
-- edge/target/alt.hcl --
inputs = {}
-- edge/target/main.tf --
output "out" {
  value = 1
}
-- edge/nodir/README.md --
Not a unit: this directory has no terragrunt.hcl.
-- edge/stack/terragrunt.stack.hcl --
unit "inner" {
  source = "../target"
  path   = "inner"
}
-- edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl --
dependency "nodir" {
  config_path = "../nodir"
}

dependency "stack" {
  config_path = "../stack"
}

dependency "alt" {
  config_path = "../target/alt.hcl"
}

dependency "good" {
  config_path = "../target"
}

inputs = {
  a = dependency.nodir.outputs.missing_a
  b = dependency.stack.outputs.missing_b
  c = dependency.alt.outputs.missing_c
  d = dependency.ghost.outputs.missing_d
  e = dependency.good.outputs.out
  f = dependency.good.outputs.missing
}
-- edge/dup/terragrunt.hcl --
dependency "same" {
  config_path = "../target"
}

dependency "same" {
  config_path = "../target"
}

inputs = {
  x = dependency.same.outputs.missing_x
}
-- _golden/exit --
1
-- _golden/want --
# edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl line 2: "  config_path = " is 16 bytes.
GRT002 error edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl:2:17 edge/consumer
# edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl line 23: "  f = " is 6 bytes.
GRT001 error edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl:23:7 edge/consumer
-- _golden/messages --
GRT002 edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl:2:17 dependency "nodir" config_path resolves to "edge/nodir": directory has no terragrunt.hcl
GRT001 edge/consumer/terragrunt.hcl:23:7 dependency "good" output "missing" is not declared by module "edge/target" (target unit "edge/target")
-- _golden/unknown --
edge/dup config-unknown invalid-dependency
